    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OneHealth Automation Workflow\n\n### Features:\n1. **Reads pending automations** without changing status\n2. **Processes one by one** with proper status management\n3. **Sends SMS** via centralized gateway\n4. **Sends Email** via Gmail OAuth\n5. **Tracks results** and updates status\n6. **Handles errors** gracefully with retry\n\n### Flow:\n1. Every minute, fetch pending automations\n2. Parse and validate data\n3. Process each automation:\n   - Mark as processing\n   - Send SMS if enabled\n   - Send Email if enabled\n   - Evaluate results\n   - Mark complete or failed\n4. Wait between items to prevent rate limiting\n5. Loop back for more items",
        "height": 464.5338461341094,
        "width": 389.0922747252735,
        "color": 7
      },
